 *
 * Certifies that the value reaching the alert's sink is a compile-time constant under
 * reviewed evidence families (local, no-alias analyses with independent negative tests):
 *  - container-list-slot-constant-v1    : local List slot after add-run / remove(0) shifts.
 *  - container-map-slot-constant-v1     : local Map key whose last write is a constant.
 *  - container-all-elements-constant-v1 : local collection/array passed whole, elements constant.
 *  - constant-selector-branch-v1        : value selected by a switch with a constant selector.
 * Constant chains through casts, concatenation, local variables (dominance / all-definitions
